{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_10aa696aa08f7227c6c28225dced3c7ed40b84bcfbfbc7f935cdf032f2c008b0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The experimental convoy engine runs long tasks in dependency order across isolated git worktrees with SQLite persistence so crashes resume rather than restart."},{"claim_ids":["clm_151850951726e5b919a3bba97b8d0bbcc2ee7e654e666a2c109694cb2a52f81a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Convoy is invoked via 'opencastle convoy \"<task>\"', with bare convoy showing run state and 'convoy resume' continuing after interruption."},{"claim_ids":["clm_18aedf9b60a07a8dfecd3d4bb8198ed4979070f0f82189706ba445cbe11518e0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Running opencastle with no arguments reports installed targets, sync/drift state per assistant, and suggests the next command such as running sync."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1b6c4432a08887fe775af4e489abe7784f67862803984f8619bb03f3cbb1d6a1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"OpenCastle compiles to native formats for seven assistants including Claude Code (CLAUDE.md + .claude/), Cursor, Windsurf, Copilot, OpenCode, Codex CLI, and Antigravity."},{"claim_ids":["clm_54f42e89394cfa61fd2e6f98dc5deffb1a467d9edd73c0a0124e57e391d39333"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The convoy engine is explicitly labeled experimental and may change; the compiler does not depend on it."},{"claim_ids":["clm_584ee797f3939285b5986aae939f25e1f2fdb047238c147329618fee438e7c7c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agents declare capability tiers (premium, standard, economy) instead of pinned model names, letting the user's assistant choose the concrete model."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5d839887db4c8d4b2bb40284b08faddf7c32e5658f394de783d53eac5733efde"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI exposes commands including bare status, sync (with --check for CI drift detection), add, and doctor, per the README's everyday-use examples."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b8a7094ff45ebec4632a0dd0a5df899f48cb6f39f7255566681555aa18fd81fd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors fork, branch as feat/ or fix/, ensure npm test and npx tsc --noEmit pass, then open a PR."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d4cfc6dea62942ca25475b8609e3485a6fb97daef9e1379fa1dc2d6d6118399a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The init command scans the repository for existing assistant config, framework, database, and test runner, then shows findings and asks a single confirmation."},{"claim_ids":["clm_dead6bf90aa07ecb23999bdcb3c7b6c3b293328c0ebd95424b1caad7bcd87a55"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Compiled content includes 13 role agent definitions, 31 domain skills plus 31 tool integrations loaded on demand, and 9 workflow templates."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e13e8a900c50387938ff469bd2ae46ea7162b5227c5fef98936fdda51e8a31b0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: a CI workflow runs 'npx opencastle sync --check' on Node 22, and generated config is committed like a lockfile so the check has something to compare."}],"claim_ids":["clm_10aa696aa08f7227c6c28225dced3c7ed40b84bcfbfbc7f935cdf032f2c008b0","clm_151850951726e5b919a3bba97b8d0bbcc2ee7e654e666a2c109694cb2a52f81a","clm_18aedf9b60a07a8dfecd3d4bb8198ed4979070f0f82189706ba445cbe11518e0","clm_1b6c4432a08887fe775af4e489abe7784f67862803984f8619bb03f3cbb1d6a1","clm_54f42e89394cfa61fd2e6f98dc5deffb1a467d9edd73c0a0124e57e391d39333","clm_584ee797f3939285b5986aae939f25e1f2fdb047238c147329618fee438e7c7c","clm_5d839887db4c8d4b2bb40284b08faddf7c32e5658f394de783d53eac5733efde","clm_b8a7094ff45ebec4632a0dd0a5df899f48cb6f39f7255566681555aa18fd81fd","clm_d4cfc6dea62942ca25475b8609e3485a6fb97daef9e1379fa1dc2d6d6118399a","clm_dead6bf90aa07ecb23999bdcb3c7b6c3b293328c0ebd95424b1caad7bcd87a55","clm_e13e8a900c50387938ff469bd2ae46ea7162b5227c5fef98936fdda51e8a31b0"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:10:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_7dff1eb3f5d0495d950b97632d6afff2","id":"pg_918eb928645f523186ff85e9a40bedf5","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/monkilabs-opencastle-readme-md-f297837635b1-85e9a40bedf5.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_98e6e24399395741aca7c37edb727bff"],"title":"monkilabs/opencastle/README.md @ f297837635b1","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:10:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7dff1eb3f5d0495d950b97632d6afff2"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_b6bebd0c4ddf4db21dd2dc5aae8b6717cebdf33196940f6d26ed14187e119e37"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A proposed split plan indicates the post-split OpenCastle product would have zero runtime dependencies, while Convoy would depend on the Copilot SDK, valibot, yaml, and node:sqlite."}],"claim_ids":["clm_b6bebd0c4ddf4db21dd2dc5aae8b6717cebdf33196940f6d26ed14187e119e37"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:10:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_7dff1eb3f5d0495d950b97632d6afff2","id":"pg_bedf6f1e615f533191f7939cf9a79957","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/monkilabs-opencastle-docs-plans-2026-07-27-convoy-split-plan-md-f29783-939cf9a79957.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_c92f97ca62555e9bacb4152db5b601a4"],"title":"monkilabs/opencastle/docs/plans/2026-07-27-convoy-split-plan.md @ f297837635b1","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:10:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7dff1eb3f5d0495d950b97632d6afff2"}
